sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 Usuario
    participant Frontend as 🌐 Frontend (Angular)
    participant InsightsAPI as 🟢 Insights API
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant PredictionAPI as 🟡 Prediction API
    participant TariffAPI as 🟣 Tariff API

    User->>Frontend: Abre dashboard
    Frontend->>InsightsAPI: GET /api/v1/dashboard/summary
    InsightsAPI->>ConAPI: GET /api/v1/consumption/current
    ConAPI-->>InsightsAPI: {consumption: 5.2kW}
    InsightsAPI->>PredictionAPI: POST /predict<br/>{household_id}
    PredictionAPI-->>InsightsAPI: {prediction: 250kWh/mes}
    InsightsAPI->>TariffAPI: GET /tariffs
    TariffAPI-->>InsightsAPI: {cost_per_kwh: 0.142}
    InsightsAPI->>InsightsAPI: Aggregate & calculate
    InsightsAPI-->>Frontend: {summary, charts,<br/>recommendations}
    Frontend->>Frontend: Render charts
    Frontend-->>User: ✓ Dashboard actualizado
